# Every libSystem symbol a Hirsel program may import on aarch64-apple-darwin, one Mach-O
# name per line, sorted. link_kit.py turns it into the kit's libSystem.tbd, so a name
# left off is unlinkable. fsync and fdatasync never appear: Darwin durability is
# fcntl(F_FULLFSYNC) (STORE-SPEC §3.3c). Each name must be in Zig's libSystem.tbd.

